{
  "description": "std-hero — the headline block at the top of a page, or a call-to-action banner further down. Optional eyebrow badge, headline, supporting text, up to two link actions, an optional copyable command, optional media below or beside the copy, and an optional backdrop scene behind it all. `look: banner` turns it into a contained call-to-action card. Links follow `href` (in-app path, #anchor, or absolute URL); each click also emits CTA_PRIMARY / CTA_SECONDARY with the href. Pick for landing, product, pricing and campaign pages.",
